Replayable synthetic ECDLP/PDP training datasets and immutable artifact receipts

Usage: crypto dataset [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  custody       Create, verify, publish or restore a restricted full-run custody bundle
  start         Validate a delivered launch grant and start the frozen bounded worker
  budget        Inspect or reserve cumulative campaign allocations; admission is not launch authorization
  plan          Freeze a deterministic cross-product; planning performs no cryptography
  generate      Execute a bounded number of cells, preserving failures and resuming verified cells
  preflight     Check readable frozen inputs, clean build identity and receipt routing without running cryptography
  verify        Hash-check every artifact and independently replay known-answer identities
  status        Count recorded outcomes without rerunning any solver
  report        Write an immutable partial coverage and measurement report from retained artifacts
  publish       Publish all completed cell manifests and round-trip their bytes through the store
  capabilities  Show actual method support and instrumentation limits
  export        Produce strict public features and separate restricted labels from replayed cells
  restore       Download and independently replay a completed cell from its portable receipt
  reconcile     Preserve an interrupted attempt after proving no matching worker remains
  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --color <COLOR>
          Color output mode: `auto` (default), `always`, or `never`. `auto` enables colors only on TTY.  Respected by every visual renderer [default: auto]
      --owned-replay-policy <OWNED_REPLAY_POLICY>
          Independently bounded owned-search capture and row replay allowance
      --owned-replay-receipt <OWNED_REPLAY_RECEIPT>
          
      --search-replay-policy <SEARCH_REPLAY_POLICY>
          
      --search-replay-receipt <SEARCH_REPLAY_RECEIPT>
          
      --sat-replay-policy <SAT_REPLAY_POLICY>
          Independently authorized finite historical SAT replay allowance
      --sat-replay-receipt <SAT_REPLAY_RECEIPT>
          
      --affine-replay-policy <AFFINE_REPLAY_POLICY>
          
      --affine-replay-receipt <AFFINE_REPLAY_RECEIPT>
          
  -h, --help
          Print help
